      "id": "claim_d11a9fdf28d948e6b6476bf2bd31f3a6",
      "statement": "The clip editor lives in the existing AnimationTools.Editor assembly rather than a new asmdef, so that authoring a track needs no extra assembly reference and so that AnimationTools.Tests, which already references AnimationTools.Editor, can unit-test the axis, tick, registry and footfall-edit types with no plumbing.",
